  86→
  87→  The centre code is output in the summary for populating the centre
  88→  directory spreadsheet.
  89→
  90→EXAMPLES:
  91→  # Auto-discover everything (recommended)
  92→  bun onboard-centre.ts --name "Riverside"
  93→
  94→  # Override area code and country manually
  95→  bun onboard-centre.ts --name "Leaside" --area-code "647" --country CA
  96→
  97→  # Dry run — preview without executing
  98→  bun onboard-centre.ts --name "Riverside" --dry-run
  99→
