 101→  0. Discover  — Search codeninjas.com for centre details
 102→  1. Twilio    — Sub-account + phone + SIP trunk
 103→  2. Retell    — Create LLM copy (with centre name hardcoded)
 104→  3. Retell    — Clone agent
 105→  4. Retell    — Import phone number + link to agent
 106→  5. Cekura    — Create test agent
 107→  6. Cekura    — Create Tier 2 scenarios (Location Verify + Happy Path)
 108→  7. Cekura    — Print Tier 2 cron update instructions
 109→  8. ChatDash  — Print manual setup instructions
 110→  9. Google    — Write centre directory row via n8n webhook
 111→  10. Email    — Send client onboarding email (auto-populated)
 112→  11. Hiya     — Print branded caller ID instructions
 113→  12. Checklist — Send internal manual-items email to Scott
 114→  13. Summary  — Print all created resource IDs
